napshot tests device change by @kris-skierniewski in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/306\r\n* GOVUKAPP-3874 Update qualtrics theme colours by @1pretz1 in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/296\r\n* GOVUKAPP-3945 Add autoClose option by @1pretz1 in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/307\r\n* GOVUKAPP-3758 Add quarterly survey button by @1pretz1 in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/303\r\n* merge dvla private beta into main by @kris-skierniewski in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/309\r\n* Feature/govukapp 3192 update readme by @Krishna in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/310\r\n* GOVUKAPP-3968 Add heading attribute to tax and MOT headings by @kris-skierniewski in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/311\r\n* feat: NOT-372 country selection list states by @BradleyR-Apadmi in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/314\r\n* GOVUKAPP-3885 - Move NotificationCentreViewModel+MockData out of Production by @mansoor-dsit in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/312\r\n* Refactor Notification by @batesyuk in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/316\r\n* fix: NOT-506 improve IconActionCardView voiceover accessibility by @BradleyR-Apadmi in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/317\r\n* GOVUKAPP-3954 Chat question prompts by @1pretz1 in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/313\r\n* Release 1.4 -> Main by @batesyuk in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/322\r\n* Merge DVLA -> Main by @batesyuk in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/323\r\n* GOVUKAPP-3886 Uncomment and rename message centre settings snapshot tests by @mansoor-dsit in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/320\r\n* Updated ruby gems by @mansoor-dsit in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/321\r\n* NOT-415 Country search by @BradleyR-Apadmi in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/319\r\n* GOVUKAPP-3497 Dismiss keyboard before navigating from LocalAuthorityPostcodeEntry by @kris-skierniewski in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/318\r\n* GOVUKAPP-2496 Persist selected topics tab in user defaults by @kris-skierniewski in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/325\r\n* GOVUKAPP-4005 Prevent multiple suggested chat questions being clicked at once by @mansoor-dsit in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/329\r\n* GOVUKAPP-3956 Ecom tracking example questions by @1pretz1 in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/328\r\n* Fix unit tests by @1pretz1 in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/332\r\n* Only show chat example questions view if present by @1pretz1 in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/335\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @Krishna made their first contribution in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/310\r\n* @mansoor-dsit made their first contribution in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/312\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/compare/1.5...1.6",
